[Music]  being an adult doesn't have to mean  you're stuck giving and receiving boring  practical gifts forget the tie is in the  bath sets help your loved ones embrace  their inner child here's a list of fun  geeky goods that will make them feel  like a kid again first up is Dead Rising  4 Dead Rising 4 is the perfect gift for  the zombie lover or for fans of the Dead  Rising series in the fourth installment  Frank West returns to Willamette  Colorado during the holiday season  players will explore a vast open-world  sandbox filled with zombies and a  million ways to kill them and friends  can enjoy a multiplayer match and try to  survive a night in the willamette mall  Dead Rising 4 is available for Xbox one  and Windows 10 PC give a friend an  escape from reality with an oculus rift  help your friends slip into a virtual  reality with their very own oculus rift  headset VR is unlike anything you've  ever experienced and you don't need to  be a gamer to appreciate it step into a  game watch a movie or travel the world  all from the comfort of your own home  make sure they have a Windows PC in  order to use the rift quality VR comes  with a hefty price tag the oculus rift  will set you back $600  speaking of PC gaming we have a couple  of recommendations for the PC gamer in  your life first you'll need a good  gaming mouse  we recommend the logitech g502 this high  performance gaming mouse precisely  translates your hand movements on screen  with an advanced optical gaming sensor  the g502 is well reviewed and known for  its comfort and build quality the g502  retails for $79.99 or you can opt for a  new stylish gaming keyboard with the  corsair strafe RGB Corsairs strafe RGB  mechanical gaming keyboard looks and  feels great it's textured and contoured  keycaps make typing comfortable and easy  it's multi color backlighting is fully  adjustable and works with hundreds of  downloadable lighting effects the strafe  RGB retails for 130 $9.99 how about a  versatile gaming headset that works with  PC and consoles  check out the HyperX cloud stinger the  HyperX cloud singer prides itself on its  lightweight comfort and sound quality  this headset has rotating ear cups with  memory foam who's also volume control on  the headset ear cup and a swivel to mute  noise cancelling mic best of all it's  compatible with multiple platforms  PC Xbox one ps4 and we you get it for  $49.99 you're never too old to like  aliens ninjas dinosaurs or zombies all  these and more included and smash up  smash up is a fun shuffle building car  game where each player combines two  factions into one deck use a team of  robots and dinosaurs or wizards and  pirates and compete to smash the most  spaces I've owned this for months and I  still love playing it for the variety of  teams and matchups it's easy to learn  and you can play with two to four  players get smash up for $29.99 and once  you get tired of the factions in the  first set there are quite a few  expansions like the science-fiction  double feature set for 22 and 99 if  you're looking for a great organ to give  a loved one I recommend pandemic  pandemic is a co-op board game where two  to four players team up to save the  world for diseases have broken out  across the planet and it's up to your  team to find cures before outbreaks  occur and mankind is wiped out this game  is exciting immersive and I love being  able to work together with your fellow  players pandemic retails for $39.99 next  up is @y I've always wanted and still  want as an adult the Lego Star Wars  Millennium Falcon who doesn't want their  own Millennium Falcon the latest version  of this Lego set comes with updated  features and minifigures from the force  awakens it's got a detachable cockpit  rotating laser turrets detailed  hyperdrive how a chessboard and a secret  compartment get the Millennium Falcon  building kit for one $49.99 Funko pop  figures are becoming more and more  popular these cuties are all over the  desks here at GameSpot add to your  friends collection or start them off  with Funko's Street Fighter collector's  set take your friends back to their  fighting game routes with these classic  Street Fighter characters the set comes  with Ryu Ken Blancas and chun-li ready  to stand guard in your cubicle or on  your living room shelf plus they're  adorable get the Street Fighter  collector set from Funko on Amazon for  $37.99 if you're looking for a  budget-friendly gift how about these  sweet Power Rangers mugs these are  officially licensed Mighty Morphin Power  Rangers themed mugs you can choose from  the Red Ranger or the Pink Ranger these  ceramic mugs hold a surprisingly large  twenty ounces of liquid each and they're  BPA and toxin free each Power Rangers  mug is $14.99  if you've ever wanted to be mega man  you're a step closer with Capcom's Mega  Man wearable helmet replica this  official full-sized Megaman helmet is  made of high-quality plastic with a  polished finish as a clamshell hinge  which allows the helmet to open up it  comes with adjustable velcro interior  foam to fit comfortably over your head  put it on display or use it for cosplay  this Mega Man helmet retails for 150  $9.99 and that's our list of top gifts  for big kids brought to you by Dead  Rising 4 happy gifting and Happy  Holidays I'm chastity and I'll see you  next time  [Music]

